<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink182-kilavi">
       talaimakaḷ melivukaṇṭu teyvattā lāyiṟṟeṉa tamar niṉaintuḻit tōḻi aṟattoṭu niṉṟatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
         The confidante revealing the truth [about the relationship], when the relatives, having seen the frailty of the heroine, thought it was because of a God.</p>
  </div>  
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink182">
<l>neyta ṉaṟumalar ceruntiyoṭu viraiik</l>
<l>kaipuṉai naṟuntār kamaḻu mārpa</l>
<l>ṉaruntiṟaṟ kaṭavu ḷallaṉ</l>
<l>peruntuṟaik kaṇṭiva ḷaṇaṅki yōṉē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>The man with a chest upon which hand-made flower-garlands were fragrant,</l>
        <l>Having mixed blossoms of Neytal flowers with Cerunti flowers,</l>
        <l>Is not a God [with] rare powers.</l>
        <l>[Yet], he is the tormentor of this girl, [ever since] seeing [her] on the big ghat.</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
